Description: screenshot and annotation tool (PyQt6 port)
 ksnip is a cross-platform screenshot tool that provides many annotation
 features. This package provides the PyQt6 port, including screenshot
 capture, annotation with shapes, text and stickers, OCR, uploaders, and
 editable projects.
 .
 It supports capturing a rectangular area, the last selected area, the
 screen or window under the cursor, the active window, and the full screen,
 optionally including the mouse cursor. Screenshots can be annotated and
 saved to PNG, JPEG, BMP or WebP, or exported to SVG.
